    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, shoot, and survive in this adrenaline-fueled action game! Use your tongue to grapple across levels, dodge incoming fire, and gain the upper hand. With dual-wielded firepower at your disposal, take on waves of enemies in fast-paced, skill-driven combat. Master momentum, perfect your aim, and unleash destruction as you battle through a series of challenging levels. Are you ready to tongue-swing your way to victory?</p>",
